cture which creates sharp edges that children can cut themselves on as well as fallen rust pieces that may be ingested.      There is some trash and discarded pieces of plywood in the area of the oudoor play space where children may be playing.    A nest of yellow jacket wasps was found inside of a decorative bell hanging in the outdoor play area which presents a stinging hazard for caregivers and children alike.      Multiple play structures are in slight disrepair and may need cleaning, pressure washing, or replacement.    A presssure washer device is in the middle of the outdoor play space for children where they may attempt to use the hardware.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026234299","violation_type_title":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards (26 TAC §746.3701)","topic_label":"Safety hazards"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-97949-i20251023","date":"2025-10-23","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":2,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905746334","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905746334","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2025-10-23","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-97949-i20251023-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3701","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-97949-i20251023","date":"2025-10-23","original_code":"746.3701","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-11-03","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: The operation had a broken door knob, a broken step on active play equipment and damage to a support leg on another active play structure,","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026414389","violation_type_title":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards (26 TAC §746.3701)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-97949-i20251023-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-5101-a"